---
import ToolLayout from "@/layouts/ToolLayout.astro";
---

<ToolLayout title="Play Tools" description="Web-based play aids for Dungeons the Dragoning 40,000">
  <header class="text-center pt-12 px-md pb-md border-b border-border">
    <h1 class="m-0 text-[2.5rem] text-accent">Dungeons the Dragoning</h1>
    <p class="mt-sm mb-0 text-text-muted">40,000: 7th Edition — Player Tools</p>
  </header>

  <main class="grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr))] gap-lg p-xl max-w-[1200px] mx-auto">
    <a href="/tools/character-sheet/" class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-md p-lg no-underline text-text-primary transition-[transform,box-shadow,border-color] duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_4px_12px_var(--color-shadow)] hover:border-accent hover:text-text-primary">
      <h2 class="m-0 mb-sm text-accent text-[1.25rem]">Character Sheet</h2>
      <p class="m-0 text-text-muted text-[0.9rem] leading-relaxed">Freeform character sheet for creation and play. Edit all sections freely, auto-calculated derived stats, multiple character slots, and JSON import/export.</p>
      <span class="inline-block mt-md py-xs px-sm rounded-sm text-xs font-semibold uppercase bg-success-bg text-success">Ready</span>
    </a>

    <a href="/tools/character-builder/" class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-md p-lg no-underline text-text-primary transition-[transform,box-shadow,border-color] duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_4px_12px_var(--color-shadow)] hover:border-accent hover:text-text-primary">
      <h2 class="m-0 mb-sm text-accent text-[1.25rem]">Character Builder</h2>
      <p class="m-0 text-text-muted text-[0.9rem] leading-relaxed">Guided 11-step character creation wizard with priority-based allocation, XP tracking, and JSON export.</p>
      <span class="inline-block mt-md py-xs px-sm rounded-sm text-xs font-semibold uppercase bg-success-bg text-success">Ready</span>
    </a>

    <a href="/tools/dice-roller/" class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-md p-lg no-underline text-text-primary transition-[transform,box-shadow,border-color] duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_4px_12px_var(--color-shadow)] hover:border-accent hover:text-text-primary">
      <h2 class="m-0 mb-sm text-accent text-[1.25rem]">Dice Roller</h2>
      <p class="m-0 text-text-muted text-[0.9rem] leading-relaxed">Roll XkY dice pools with exploding d10s, overflow compression, and automatic Raise/Check calculation. Supports modifiers and roll history.</p>
      <span class="inline-block mt-md py-xs px-sm rounded-sm text-xs font-semibold uppercase bg-success-bg text-success">Ready</span>
    </a>

    <a href="/tools/quick-reference/" class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-md p-lg no-underline text-text-primary transition-[transform,box-shadow,border-color] duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_4px_12px_var(--color-shadow)] hover:border-accent hover:text-text-primary">
      <h2 class="m-0 mb-sm text-accent text-[1.25rem]">Quick Reference</h2>
      <p class="m-0 text-text-muted text-[0.9rem] leading-relaxed">Searchable index of conditions, action types, combat modifiers, and common rules. Find what you need fast during play.</p>
      <span class="inline-block mt-md py-xs px-sm rounded-sm text-xs font-semibold uppercase bg-success-bg text-success">Ready</span>
    </a>

    <a href="/tools/npc-generator/" class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-md p-lg no-underline text-text-primary transition-[transform,box-shadow,border-color] duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_4px_12px_var(--color-shadow)] hover:border-accent hover:text-text-primary">
      <h2 class="m-0 mb-sm text-accent text-[1.25rem]">NPC Stat Block Builder</h2>
      <p class="m-0 text-text-muted text-[0.9rem] leading-relaxed">Build NPC stat blocks with auto-calculated derived stats, trait modifiers, and 40+ templates from the core rules. Save, print, and copy as Markdown.</p>
      <span class="inline-block mt-md py-xs px-sm rounded-sm text-xs font-semibold uppercase bg-success-bg text-success">Ready</span>
    </a>

    <a href="/tools/combat-tracker/" class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-md p-lg no-underline text-text-primary transition-[transform,box-shadow,border-color] duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_4px_12px_var(--color-shadow)] hover:border-accent hover:text-text-primary">
      <h2 class="m-0 mb-sm text-accent text-[1.25rem]">Combat Tracker</h2>
      <p class="m-0 text-text-muted text-[0.9rem] leading-relaxed">Initiative order management, HP and resource tracking, condition toggles. Keep your battles organized.</p>
      <span class="inline-block mt-md py-xs px-sm rounded-sm text-xs font-semibold uppercase bg-success-bg text-success">Ready</span>
    </a>

    <a href="/tools/ship-builder/" class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-md p-lg no-underline text-text-primary transition-[transform,box-shadow,border-color] duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_4px_12px_var(--color-shadow)] hover:border-accent hover:text-text-primary">
      <h2 class="m-0 mb-sm text-accent text-[1.25rem]">Ship Builder</h2>
      <p class="m-0 text-text-muted text-[0.9rem] leading-relaxed">Build and customize spelljammer ships with hull selection, consoles, weapons, shields, and crew. Includes a Sheet mode for tracking combat.</p>
      <span class="inline-block mt-md py-xs px-sm rounded-sm text-xs font-semibold uppercase bg-success-bg text-success">Ready</span>
    </a>

    <a href="/tools/success-curves/" class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-md p-lg no-underline text-text-primary transition-[transform,box-shadow,border-color] duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_4px_12px_var(--color-shadow)] hover:border-accent hover:text-text-primary">
      <h2 class="m-0 mb-sm text-accent text-[1.25rem]">Success Curve Analyzer</h2>
      <p class="m-0 text-text-muted text-[0.9rem] leading-relaxed">Visualize XkY probability distributions against Target Numbers. Compare up to 4 dice pools via Monte Carlo simulation.</p>
      <span class="inline-block mt-md py-xs px-sm rounded-sm text-xs font-semibold uppercase bg-success-bg text-success">Ready</span>
    </a>

    <a href="/tools/defense-graph/" class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-md p-lg no-underline text-text-primary transition-[transform,box-shadow,border-color] duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_4px_12px_var(--color-shadow)] hover:border-accent hover:text-text-primary">
      <h2 class="m-0 mb-sm text-accent text-[1.25rem]">Defense Graph Simulator</h2>
      <p class="m-0 text-text-muted text-[0.9rem] leading-relaxed">Visualize how damage mitigation evolves across the defense pipeline. See how armor, penetration, aura, cover, and resilience interact.</p>
      <span class="inline-block mt-md py-xs px-sm rounded-sm text-xs font-semibold uppercase bg-success-bg text-success">Ready</span>
    </a>
  </main>

  <footer class="text-center p-md text-text-muted text-[0.85rem]">
    Data extracted from <em>Dungeons the Dragoning 40,000: 7th Edition</em> and <em>For a Few Subtitles More</em>.<br />
    This is a fan-made tool. All content belongs to its respective creators.
  </footer>

</ToolLayout>
